# Build Automation for XCP-ng HL Edition

This repository is the build system for [XCP-ng HL](https://vagrantin.github.io/xcp-hl/)

## What it produces

* The [XCP-ng HL ISO](https://github.com/Vagrantin/xcp-ng-ce-iso).
* The [XOA-HL](https://github.com/Vagrantin/xoa-hl) rpm package
* The [XO Lite-ce](https://github.com/Vagrantin/xolite-ce) rpm package
* The [XOA Proxy](https://github.com/Vagrantin/xoa-proxy) rpm package
* The [XOA VM](https://github.com/Vagrantin/build-xoa-hl) xva image

## What's in here

* **`orchestratorhost/`** — builds the machine the automation itself runs on.
* **`xcp-orchestrator/`** — the automation: the agents that watch, build and publish.

Each folder has its own README covering setup, configuration and the technical
details.

